{"id":"bbq3dw0f4vs7xj7ofkscbfybq","title":"中国酿酒技术5000年前使用红曲霉过滤发酵","originalTitle":"How Chinese brewers refined their booze 5,000 years ago","summary":"研究人员在浙江 WAYAOLI 站点发现了距今约 5000-5300 年的 16 个陶器残片，其中五个独特的过滤器含有红曲霉和稻米残留物，表明当时使用红曲霉发酵和过滤米酒。过滤器还包含狐坚果的淀粉，可能为另一种原料。这些发现揭示了早期酿酒技术如何将酒精与发酵谷物分离。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-chinese-brewers-refined-booze-years.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T17:40:23.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-13T17:41:36.230Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-13T17:41:36.230Z","category":null,"tags":["论文发表"],"score":25,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"863235d0-4947-4e96-86ee-cccc83f5827e","title":"中国5000年前使用红曲霉过滤发酵米酒"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"863235d0-4947-4e96-86ee-cccc83f5827e","title":"中国5000年前使用红曲霉过滤发酵米酒"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f_nwcJJoNpNk","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}